# `a === b` is `a.same(b)`, whether two names reach the same memory: only an address or a span declares it.

### A point.
record Point
    x: S64
    y: S64

### Points are never the same memory.
### :param other: The other point.
### :returns: Whether the two are the same.
routine Point.same(other: Me) -> Bool
    return me.x == other.x

### Unused.
routine start() -> None
    return
